#: data/maps/MtPyre_5F/scripts.inc:11
msgctxt "MtPyre_4F_Text_TashaIntro"
msgid ""
"I love all things horrifying…\n"
"It's like a disease…\p"
"When I'm here…\n"
"I shiver with fear…$"
msgstr ""
"我喜欢一切恐怖的东西……\n"
"就像生病了一样……\p"
"待在这里的时候……\n"
"我害怕得发抖……$"

