#: data/maps/MtPyre_5F/scripts.inc:20
msgctxt "MtPyre_4F_Text_TashaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I want to see dreadful things…\n"
"I can't leave…\p"
"Stay…\n"
"Won't you stay with me?$"
msgstr ""
"我想看看可怕的东西……\n"
"我不能离开……\p"
"留下来……\n"
"你不和我一起留下来吗？$"
